#: index.docbook:568
#, no-c-format
msgid "Where does &kab; store the address book?"
msgstr "¿Dónde almacena &kab; la libreta de direcciones?"

#: index.docbook:571
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The default address book database is stored at "
"<filename>~/.kde/share/apps/kab/addressbook.kab</filename>, any new "
"databases that you have created will be stored wherever you put them."
msgstr ""
"La libreta de direcciones predeterminada se almacena en "
"<filename>~/.kde/share/apps/kab/addressbook.kab</filename>, cualquiera base "
"de datos nueva que haya sido creada será almacenada donde se quiera."

#: index.docbook:580
#, no-c-format
msgid "What configuration files does &kab; use?"
msgstr "¿Qué ficheros de configuración usa &kab;?"

#: index.docbook:583
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The file <filename>~/.kde/share/apps/kab/kab.config</filename> holds your "
"&kab; <quote>preferences</quote> and the command strings for mail and talk."
msgstr ""
"El fichero <filename>~/.kde/share/apps/kab/kab.config</filename> mantiene "
"las <quote>preferencias</quote> de &kab; y las cadenas de comandos para "
"enviar correo y de <quote>talk</quote>"

#: index.docbook:587
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<filename>~/.kde/share/config/kabrc</filename> holds general &kab; "
"appearance parameters and a list of the most recently visited address books."
msgstr ""
"<filename>~/.kde/share/config/kabrc</filename> mantiene los parámetros de "
"apariencia general de &kab; y una lista de las libreta de direcciones más "
"recientemente visitadas."

#: index.docbook:591
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Don't modify these files unless you really know what you are doing (and have "
"made a back up)."
msgstr ""
"No se debe modificar estos ficheros al no ser que realmente se sepa lo que "
"se está haciendo ( y se haya realizado una copia de seguridad)."

